    "show_share": true,
    "description": "National Quit Smoking Day will be observed in Pakistan on the 1st of Ramazan. To counsel smokers on how to quit smoking, a seminar is being held at Aga Khan University, Karachi on October 12, 2004 at 2:00 PM at Lecture Hall 2.",
